OL,3,GNEWSASix-person relay race won by team
OL,4,Aof two
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo friends who entered a relay race
OL,7,Fmeant to be completed in teams of six
OL,8,Fhave been crowned the event's winners.
OL,10,FJosh Elston-Carr and Jack Gray entered
OL,11,FSunday's Chariots of Fire race in
OL,12,FCambridge as a two-man team, racing
OL,13,Fagainst 50 other teams of six.
OL,15,FThe race ` inspired by the film of the
OL,16,Fsame name ` sees runners complete two
OL,17,Fmiles (3.2km) around the city centre
OL,18,Fbefore passing their baton for the next
OL,19,Floop.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
